        "original_id": "98ac241f-b9ea-554c-87e2-e10398095140",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen R. Donaldson, Michael Moorcock\n- Products: The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant, Against All Things Ending, Behold the Man\n- Topics: fantasy literature, science fiction, mystery fiction\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Moorcock was born on 18 December 1939 and is an English writer primarily known for science fiction and fantasy who has also published literary novels.\n- Stephen R. Donaldson was born on May 13, 1947 and is an American fantasy, science fiction, and mystery novelist.\n- Behold the Man was published in 1969 as a science fiction novel by British writer Michael Moorcock.\n- Against All Things Ending was published in 2010 as a fantasy novel by American writer Stephen R. Donaldson.\n- Stephen R. Donaldson is most famous for The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant, a ten-novel fantasy series.",
